{"timestamp": 1759743737.2460575, "command": "git commit -m \"Enable context management tools in default agent profiles\n\nThe context management tools (list_history, memory, call_context_tool) were\nsuccessfully implemented and registered, but weren't available to the LLM agent\nbecause they weren't enabled in the agent profile settings.\n\nRoot cause: Zed's agent system requires tools to be explicitly enabled in\nprofile settings (assets/settings/default.json) even after registration in\nthe ToolRegistry.\n\nChanges:\n- Added list_history, memory, and call_context_tool to 'write' profile\n- Added list_history, memory, and call_context_tool to 'ask' profile\n- Created CONTEXT_TOOLS_INTEGRATION.md documenting the two-tier tool system\n- Documented the tool registration and enablement flow\n\nThis completes the integration of context management tools into Zed.\"", "env": {"PATH": "/usr/sbin:/home/torstein.sornes/.cargo/bin:/home/torstein.sornes/.local/bin:/home/torstein.sornes/.pyenv/bin:/home/torstein.sornes/.local/share/pipx/venvs/basedpyright/bin:/home/torstein.sornes/scripts:/home/torstein.sornes/bin:/home/torstein.sornes/.config/emacs/bin:/home/torstein.sornes/.pixi/bin:/usr/local/bin:/usr/bin:/bin:/usr/local/sbin:/sbin:/var/lib/snapd/snap/bin", "HOME": "/home/torstein.sornes", "LANG": "en_US.UTF-8", "SHELL": "/usr/bin/fish", "TERM": "xterm-256color", "DISPLAY": ":0", "WAYLAND_DISPLAY": "wayland-0", "XDG_RUNTIME_DIR": "/run/user/1000", "DBUS_SESSION_BUS_ADDRESS": "unix:path=/run/user/1000/bus", "XAUTHORITY": "/run/user/1000/xauth_GkssBx", "SSH_AUTH_SOCK": "/run/user/1000/ssh-agent.socket", "SUDO_ASKPASS": "/usr/bin/ksshaskpass"}, "origins": {"PATH": "inherited_base", "HOME": "inherited_base", "LANG": "inherited_base", "SHELL": "inherited_base", "TERM": "inherited_base", "DISPLAY": "inherited_gui", "WAYLAND_DISPLAY": "inherited_gui", "XDG_RUNTIME_DIR": "inherited_gui", "DBUS_SESSION_BUS_ADDRESS": "inherited_gui", "XAUTHORITY": "inherited_gui", "SSH_AUTH_SOCK": "i